---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: FabricationConcept[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for planProduction. Translate each concept into a production route with material preparation, operations, finishing, assembly, and inspection. Identify outsourced steps and dependencies, reserve realistic capacity, and retain specialist approval requirements for consequential structural or safety questions. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
